pyproject configuration, with an async dbapi.

## Dev Notes

**Alembic initialization**

Visit: https://alembic.sqlalchemy.org/en/latest/tutorial.html

```bash
# available templates
alembic list_templates
```
```bash
# initialize with template
alembic init -t async <dir-name>
alembic init -t async alembic
```

**Migrations**
```bash
# generate a migration.
# equivalen to django `manage.py makemigrations`
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "migration message"
```

```bash
# migrate
# equivalent to django `manage.py migrate`
alembic upgrade head
```

**Verify**
```bash
alembic current
alembic history
```